{"seq":3,"slug":"error-recovery-gui","title":"错误恢复","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/computer-use-gui-agents/action/error-recovery-gui","wordCount":1566,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"错误恢复\">错误恢复</h1><p>回到 <a href=\"../foundations/gui-agent-challenges\">GUI 智能体挑战</a> 里那个吓人的公式：单步成功率 95% 的智能体，跑一个 30 步的任务，整体成功率只有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>0.95</mn><mn>30</mn></msup><mo>≈</mo><mn>0.21</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.95^{30} \\approx 0.21</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.9</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">30</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.21</span></span></span></span></span>。这个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>p</mi><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p^n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8588em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 连乘诅咒意味着，光靠「把单步做得更准」永远追不上长任务的衰减——20% 的失败率里绝大多数来自「其中某一步崩了、然后全盘皆输」。打破诅咒的唯一办法，是让失败的步骤可被检测、可被救回。错误恢复因此不是锦上添花，而是 demo 与生产之间那道最宽的鸿沟：能恢复的智能体才敢上线。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-把-p-n-变成可修复\">核心概念：把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>p</mi><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p^n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8588em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 变成可修复</h2><p>无恢复时整体成功率是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>p</mi><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p^n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8588em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。引入恢复后，每一步失败都有机会被检测并重试，等效于把单步成功率从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 抬到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>p</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p&#x27;</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9463em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（一次不行再来一次）。若一步允许重试到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 次且每次独立，则该步等效失败率降到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>p</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>k</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(1-p)^k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0991em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi>p</mi><mtext>step</mtext><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>p</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>k</mi></msup><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo>⇒</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>success</mtext></msub><mo>≈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>p</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>n</mi></msup><mo>≫</mo><msup><mi>p</mi><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p&#x27;_{\\text{step}} = 1 - (1-p)^k \\quad\\Rightarrow\\quad P_{\\text{success}} \\approx (p&#x27;)^{n} \\gg p^{n}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.185em;vertical-align:-0.3831em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8019em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.453em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">step</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3831em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1491em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⇒</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">success</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0519em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8019em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7144em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≫</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9088em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7144em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>代入 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.95</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p=0.95, k=3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.95</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span>，单步等效成功率升到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mn>0.05</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>≈</mo><mn>0.99987</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1-0.05^3 \\approx 0.99987</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.0</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.99987</span></span></span></span></span>，30 步整体从 21% 拉回到 99.6%。这条数字就是错误恢复存在的全部理由。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[执行一个动作] --&gt; B[观测新截图]&#10;  B --&gt; C{验证: 达到预期状态?}&#10;  C --&gt;|是| D[进入下一步]&#10;  C --&gt;|否| E[诊断失败类型]&#10;  E --&gt; F{可重试?}&#10;  F --&gt;|点空/未加载| G[重试或等待后重试]&#10;  F --&gt;|界面变了| H[重定位后再试]&#10;  F --&gt;|陷入死循环| I[跳出: 换策略/回退]&#10;  F --&gt;|不可恢复| J[升级给人类]&#10;  G --&gt; B&#10;  H --&gt; B&#10;  I --&gt; B\">flowchart TD\n  A[执行一个动作] --&gt; B[观测新截图]\n  B --&gt; C{验证: 达到预期状态?}\n  C --&gt;|是| D[进入下一步]\n  C --&gt;|否| E[诊断失败类型]\n  E --&gt; F{可重试?}\n  F --&gt;|点空/未加载| G[重试或等待后重试]\n  F --&gt;|界面变了| H[重定位后再试]\n  F --&gt;|陷入死循环| I[跳出: 换策略/回退]\n  F --&gt;|不可恢复| J[升级给人类]\n  G --&gt; B\n  H --&gt; B\n  I --&gt; B</pre><h2 id=\"第一关-检测-你得先知道自己错了\">第一关：检测——你得先知道自己错了</h2><p>恢复的前提是承认失败，而这恰恰最难。智能体最危险的模式不是出错，而是「出了错却以为成功」——点空了却继续填下一个字段，最后提交一张残缺的表单。所以每个动作后都要做<strong>验证</strong>：拿新截图核对是否达到了预期状态。这与 <a href=\"task-planning-gui\">任务规划</a> 里「每子目标后验证而非假设成功」是同一件事的下沉执行。</p>\n<p>常见的检测信号有三类：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>信号</th>\n<th>判据</th>\n<th>典型失败</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>状态断言</td>\n<td>预期元素是否出现（如「登录后应见到仪表盘」）</td>\n<td>点空、未加载</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>无变化检测</td>\n<td>连续两帧截图几乎相同</td>\n<td>点了没反应</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>异常信号</td>\n<td>弹出错误提示、红色校验、404</td>\n<td>输入非法、权限不足</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>「无变化检测」尤其重要：它是识别死循环的第一道闸——如果动作前后屏幕没变，多半这一步没生效。</p>\n<h2 id=\"第二关-诊断与分型处置\">第二关：诊断与分型处置</h2><p>检测到失败后，不能一律「重试」了事，得按失败类型分开处置：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>瞬态失败（点空、页面还在加载）</strong>：等一等再重试往往就好。这对应 <a href=\"action-space\">动作空间</a> 里那个显式的 <code>wait</code> / <code>screenshot</code> 动作——不假设动作即时生效，而是等稳定了再观测。</li>\n<li><strong>定位漂移（界面变了、元素移位）</strong>：重试同一坐标只会继续点错，必须回到 <a href=\"../perception/element-grounding\">元素定位</a> 重新定位当前屏幕上的目标，再动作。</li>\n<li><strong>死循环（反复做同一无效动作）</strong>：靠无变化检测或动作历史去重识别，一旦确认就必须<strong>跳出</strong>——换一条路径、回退一步、或换用另一种定位路线，而不是第 N 次点同一个死按钮。</li>\n<li><strong>不可恢复（权限不足、任务前提不成立）</strong>：识别出「再试也没用」，及时停手升级给人类，避免在错误的世界里徒劳消耗昂贵推理。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>分型的价值在于：用对了处置手段，重试才真的把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 抬上去；用错了（对定位漂移一味重试），重试反而只是在烧钱。</p>\n<h2 id=\"反思与重规划-从局部修补到全局调整\">反思与重规划：从局部修补到全局调整</h2><p>前面讲的是「步」级修补。当失败不是某一步的偶然，而是当前子目标的路线本身走不通时（比如「以为能从菜单进入，结果这个版本根本没这个菜单」），就需要更高层的<strong>重规划</strong>：回到 <a href=\"task-planning-gui\">任务规划</a> 的上层，废弃当前子目标路径，换一条。触发重规划的判断常借助反思（reflection）——让模型回看最近几步的推理和结果，自我批评「我是不是走错方向了」。</p>\n<p>反思与重规划的通用机制属于智能体规划范畴，见跨库的 <a href=\"../../llm-agent-planning/adaptation/reflection-self-critique\">反思与自我批评</a> 和 <a href=\"../../llm-agent-planning/adaptation/replanning-recovery\">重规划与恢复</a>；本篇只强调 GUI 特化的触发条件：GUI 的反思几乎总是由「观测与预期不符」这个视觉信号触发的，而非纯语言推理里的逻辑矛盾。恢复的层次因此是一个阶梯——先试步级重试，不行再定位重做，再不行才动用代价更高的重规划，最后才升级给人。</p>\n<h2 id=\"恢复能力如何被证明\">恢复能力如何被证明</h2><p>一个智能体到底「能不能恢复」，不能靠 demo 里跑通一次就下结论——必须在会主动制造失败的基准里量化。这正是为什么 OSWorld 这类跑真实开放式任务、自动验证最终状态的基准如此关键：它天然包含大量需要中途纠错才能完成的任务，把「恢复能力」压进了成功率数字里。恢复做得好不好，最终由 <a href=\"../practice/gui-agent-evaluation\">评测 (OSWorld/WebArena)</a> 说了算，而不是由「看起来很稳」的观感说了算。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>错误恢复是打破 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>p</mi><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p^n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8588em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 连乘诅咒的唯一手段：允许每步重试 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 次可把等效单步成功率从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span> 拉到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>p</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>k</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1-(1-p)^k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0991em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，长任务整体成功率随之从 21% 级别回到 99% 级别。</li>\n<li>恢复的第一关是检测——最危险的是「错了却以为成功」；靠状态断言、无变化检测、异常信号三类信号识别失败。</li>\n<li>检测后按类型分型处置：瞬态等待重试、定位漂移重新定位、死循环强制跳出、不可恢复及时升级——用错处置只会烧钱。</li>\n<li>当整条子目标路线走不通时升级到反思与重规划；GUI 的反思由「观测与预期不符」的视觉信号触发。恢复能力最终由 OSWorld 这类基准的成功率证明。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读-跨库链接\">延伸阅读 / 跨库链接</h2><ul>\n<li>恢复的上层：<a href=\"task-planning-gui\">任务规划</a>——每步验证与重规划的触发。</li>\n<li>恢复依赖的原语与定位：<a href=\"action-space\">动作空间 (点击/输入)</a> 的 wait/screenshot、<a href=\"../perception/element-grounding\">元素定位</a> 的重定位。</li>\n<li>恢复能力的度量：<a href=\"../practice/gui-agent-evaluation\">评测 (OSWorld/WebArena)</a>。</li>\n<li>跨库（规划）：<a href=\"../../llm-agent-planning/adaptation/replanning-recovery\">重规划与恢复</a> 与 <a href=\"../../llm-agent-planning/adaptation/reflection-self-critique\">反思与自我批评</a>——通用恢复机制。</li>\n<li>跨库（智能体）：<a href=\"../../ai-agent-development/orchestration/error-recovery\">错误恢复</a>——智能体编排层的恢复模式。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"错误恢复","id":"错误恢复"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：把 p^n 变成可修复","id":"核心概念-把-p-n-变成可修复"},{"level":2,"text":"第一关：检测——你得先知道自己错了","id":"第一关-检测-你得先知道自己错了"},{"level":2,"text":"第二关：诊断与分型处置","id":"第二关-诊断与分型处置"},{"level":2,"text":"反思与重规划：从局部修补到全局调整","id":"反思与重规划-从局部修补到全局调整"},{"level":2,"text":"恢复能力如何被证明","id":"恢复能力如何被证明"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读 / 跨库链接","id":"延伸阅读-跨库链接"}],"prev":{"title":"任务规划","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/computer-use-gui-agents/action/task-planning-gui"},"next":{"title":"评测 (OSWorld/WebArena)","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/computer-use-gui-agents/practice/gui-agent-evaluation"}}